<title>USA: Covenant Bank results for Oct 1996.</title>
<headline>Covenant Bank results for Oct 1996.</headline>
<dateline>HADDONFIELD, N.J. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>STATEMENTS OF OPERATION</p>
<p>			   One month ended		Ten mos ended</p>
<p>				Oct 31, 1996		 Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p> Net interest income	$1,269,000		  $12,433,000</p>
<p> Provision of loan loss	  1,000			525,000</p>
<p>Net interest income after</p>
<p>provision for loan loss</p>
<p>				   1,268,000		   11,908,000</p>
<p> Total other income	     99,000			899,000</p>
<p> Total other expense	   936,000		   10,617,000</p>
<p> Income before income taxes  431,000		    2,190,000</p>
<p> Income taxes		    155,000			891,000</p>
<p> Net income			276,000		    1,299,000</p>
<p>The bank said that Oct was the first month of combined operations after the acquisition of 1st Southern State Bank on September 27 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
